            "Total chunks: 237\n",
            "Sample chunk: The National Building Code (P.D. 1096) 1 NATIONAL BUILDING CODE OF THE PHILIPPINES MALACAÑANG Manila PRESIDENTIAL DECREE NO. 1096 ADOPTING A NATIONAL BUILDING CODE OF THE PHILIPPINES THEREBY REVISING REPUBLIC ACT NUMBERED SIXTY-FIVE HUNDRED FORTY ONE WHEREAS, the country’s accelerating economic and \n"
