        "## **SECTION 5. System Evaluation**\n",
        "The chatbot was evaluated using a held-out (unseen) question set derived from the National Building Code of the Philippines (NBCP). These questions were not used during prompt tuning, chunk-size selection, keyword-gating adjustments, or other development iterations. Each test item includes: (1) a user-style question, (2) a short gold answer based on the NBCP clause, and (3) the gold evidence page(s) (gold_pages) where the supporting clause appears in the NBCP PDF. This enables evaluation of both (a) whether the retriever surfaced the correct evidence and (b) whether the final answer remained grounded in the retrieved context.\n",
        "\n",
        "The evaluation setup was conducted under identical retrieval settings for both backends (Gemma 7B IT and Qwen2.5 1.5B Instruct) to ensure a fair comparison. For each query, the system retrieves top-K chunks from a FAISS index and then generates an answer using the selected model while logging the retrieved page sources."
      ]
