      "source": [
        "#  5.3 Retrieval Metrics\n",
        "To isolate retrieval performance from generation performance, the retriever is evaluated using page-level evidence labels."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "execution_count": null,
      "id": "WIUdUiOLde25",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "WIUdUiOLde25"
